          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>WELLFIT was born out of my own personal struggle with weight and its impact on my health, and determined to change, I decided to start running. However, I quickly found it boring and difficult to stay consistent due to a busy work schedule, bad weather, and other obstacles, and although I eventually lost weight, I despised the process. This inspired me to create the WELLFIT Treadmill with the goal of helping others facing similar challenges stay committed to running and fitness.</p>"
          }
        }
